<title id="hero-t">A forest road from a village to a walled city</title>
<desc id="hero-d">An engraved view in warm colours: a road runs from a small village among pines, across fields and a river, toward the walled city of Oakenfell under a wide morning sky, with two travelers on the road.</desc>
